'''Baby Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases his health, range, speed and gives him the ability to release [[Wave Attack]]s. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] grants increased speed, knockback chance and Wave Attack level, as well as [[Omni Strike]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

